477
00:24:13,152 --> 00:24:15,221
iz d- der kenig

478
00:24:15,514 --> 00:24:18,902
CAROL hot gezen az dos land geyt gebrokhn

479
00:24:18,902 --> 00:24:19,861
hot er

480
00:24:19,935 --> 00:24:25,163
